+    <main>
+      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> A small study in typography</div>
+      <div class="intro"><h1>Different fonts.<br>Common ground.</h1><p>A little harmony for mixed typography.<br>Native CSS. Thoughtful proportions.<br>Everything in its right place.</p></div>
