+            <span class="small-label">One paragraph. Two personalities.</span>
+            <p id="mixed-fonts-container">Good typography makes room for everyone. Even a little <code>inline code</code> should feel at home. With <code>font-size-adjust</code>, different fonts find their balance.</p>
