+        <div class="detail"><span class="detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><div><h3>Let the browser do the math</h3><p>The first available font sets the reference.<br>CSS takes care of the rest.</p></div></div>
+        <div class="detail"><span class="detail-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span><div><h3>Room for independence</h3><p>Override the inherited value to give a theme<br>its own consistent proportions.</p></div></div>
